--     In-person, group sessions, Abhay's Annual Wellness Visits).
--   * Abhijit Gupta's and Abhay Chaudhary's user availability (10 blocks).
--   * Their Out of Office records (11).
--
-- Data only, no schema changes, and safe to re-run:
--   * An appointment is skipped when one with the same id, or the same
--     provider, date, start time and patient, is already there.
--   * Availability and Out of Office rows are skipped when their id exists.
--   * Patients, providers and appointment types are matched by name in the
--     target project (ids differ between projects). An unmatched provider
--     or type is left empty; an unmatched patient keeps the dev id.
--   * Columns the target table doesn't have yet are ignored.
--
-- Run in the Supabase SQL editor of the target project (production:
-- osnihfqqrcchsaqhagcx). Needs ooo_records and user_availability to exist.

